{"id":"t1235623","key":"mu zhong wu ren 2|2024","csv":{"title":"Mu Zhong Wu Ren 2","year":2024,"directors":["Yáng Bǐng-Jiā"],"rating":7,"watchedDate":"2026-08-19"},"status":"ok","tmdb":{"tmdbId":1235623,"imdbId":"tt30972810","wikidataId":"Q135679120","title":"Eye for an Eye 2","originalTitle":"目中无人2","altTitles":["The Blind Man 2","目中無人2","Eye for an Eye 2","目中无人：以眼还眼","Eye for an Eye 2: Blind Vengeance","Слепой меч 2"],"tagline":"","overview":"Cheng Xia Zi, un épéiste aveugle doué pour les arts martiaux, sauve accidentellement Zhang Xiao Yu, qui a souffert de la destruction de sa famille. Sous la persuasion de l'orphelin Xiao Yu, Cheng Xia Zi le garde à contrecœur à ses côtés et lui enseigne des techniques. Xiao Yu attend également l'occasion de se venger.","overviewLang":"fr","releaseDate":"2024-07-21","runtime":90,"status":"Released","genres":["Action","Drame"],"genreIds":[28,18],"countries":["China"],"originCountry":["CN"],"languages":["普通话"],"originalLanguage":"zh","directors":["杨秉佳"],"directorIds":[3242539],"writers":["杨秉佳"],"composers":[],"cinematographers":["赵晓峰"],"editors":["杨秉佳","肖鉴成"],"producers":["刘光灿","Li Xinran","孙嗣玉"],"cast":[{"id":83487,"name":"Miao Xie","character":"Cheng Xiazi","profilePath":"/fpuwLIVATZzqfnjR749rJkyQTLA.jpg"},{"id":2956442,"name":"Yang Enyou","character":"Zhang Xiaoyu","profilePath":null},{"id":2950162,"name":"黄涛","character":"Li Jiulang","profilePath":"/hdDvTSyrQN95uRuq0AgcoCDJuDc.jpg"},{"id":2494883,"name":"裴魁山","character":"Jiang Dahuzi","profilePath":"/t9ffpTQ5kQDCxds8nSNemK1Tb6d.jpg"},{"id":2813039,"name":"Pema Jyad","character":"Yao Wannian","profilePath":"/er5ckZf93iCEgqBh5gKwWJuh1BE.jpg"},{"id":2430202,"name":"刘峰超","character":"He Zhuzi","profilePath":"/uVxSCAmbA33JidS7Tf9ScDa19Wg.jpg"},{"id":2450491,"name":"Jampa Tseten","character":"Bai Shisan","profilePath":"/aKB99S7gS2pHrjCKzQdShaUsgOc.jpg"},{"id":2389989,"name":"萧松原","character":"Huang Laota","profilePath":"/xRmNiZR9sIhWKVteqqu5rnEsq8a.jpg"},{"id":3242640,"name":"江易轩"